  "name": "luh-icf_ifac_videos",
  "notes": "In this repository, we provide the video files that show the simulations of the paper:\r\n\r\nMarvin Becker, Philipp Caspers, Tom Hattendorf, Torsten Lilge, Sami Haddadin, and Matthias A. Müller. “Informed Circular Fields for Global Reactive Obstacle Avoidance of Robotic Manipulators”. In: IFAC-PapersOnLine 56.2 (2023), pp. 1017–1022. \r\ndoi: 10.1016/j.ifacol.2023.10.1698.\r\n\r\nEach scenario is represented by one exemplary video for each planner. We also added two videos showing failed attempts of our ICF planner.\r\nThe videos can be downloaded together as a zip. file or viewed in your browser.",
